1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,461
Field Shift turns ten seasons of NASA data into a farmer’s rotation plan.

2
00:00:04,861 --> 00:00:09,876
First, the farm: Field C never greens after harvest, so rye gains most there.

3
00:00:10,276 --> 00:00:13,322
Next, the farmer adds what satellites can’t see.

4
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:15,477
The hottest weeks hit corn silking.

5
00:00:16,722 --> 00:00:19,494
Three options, ranked by the farmer’s priorities.

6
00:00:19,894 --> 00:00:23,558
Then a plan: rye on Field C after the 2027 harvest.

7
00:00:23,958 --> 00:00:28,873
Checked against NASA, USDA and Drought Monitor records. The farmer decides.

